Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,打倒了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總算撐過去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村的！你沒事吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你那手臂…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:26.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回村子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不快點治療就…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別那麼大聲！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:34.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,傷口會痛啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我也是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這種狀況正常都會慌吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的沒事嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行… 血不夠了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.59,0:00:57.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然我有很多話想說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:00:59.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之先回去吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:17.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生… 你的手臂…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:19.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:20.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得快點治療！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:43.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:59.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第9話 戰後）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.59,0:03:01.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:15.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我的左手…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:18.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被吃掉了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:23.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想吃點什麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在做什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:30.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,白銀等級的戰力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對我們冒險者公會而言\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是非常珍貴的存在！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其在需要涵蓋大範圍地區的情況下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:41.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他們所扮演的角色自然會更重要！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正因如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為了能長時間運用他們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:48.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們必須審核、篩選委託才行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.47,0:03:50.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在情況允許的範圍內\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:53.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請把“盡快恢復戰力”放在第一優先\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,遠程通話結束…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 遠程通話結束\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:07.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,奧利弗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:10.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這飯… 是你的啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:13.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我太餓了嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:14.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不小心就吃掉了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:19.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:22.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到準災害級竟然有兩隻…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:26.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,完全是我們情報收集不足！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:27.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:30.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我真是非常抱歉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抬起頭來吧 奧利弗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:51.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我右手還在 沒什麼問題啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是傷患耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果這樣你能好受點\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就… 請便…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不… 什麼請便啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:11.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你胸也沒大到可以自豪啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:18.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天請你先在二樓靜養！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來探病的人一個接一個啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說莉露在幹嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天還沒看到她的臉…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大叔 你醒著嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的沒手臂了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不痛嗎？還好嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:06:00.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,傷口用治療術處理好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:04.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只是血不夠 所以叫我乖乖靜養\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:12.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自從你來到這個村子之後 這是第一次吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:15.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聽說你救了村裡的年輕人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我代表村子向你道謝\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是矮人族的族長對吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都是同一個村子的人 當然要幫\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:26.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說得也是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以坐下嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:29.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:36.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 我今天來是想說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然當什麼事都沒發生！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:41.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你失去的左手…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:45.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你談談裝義手的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我專攻機關術這一塊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:54.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,義手義足也做過幾件\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就想說你要不要試試看\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很可以啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,族長的技術超厲害的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會“嗡 喀嚓”那種！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還能幫你保養維修\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就給他做一個不就好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那要多少錢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,村子跟公會會出吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:16.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就拜託了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:19.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這案子我接下了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我先告辭\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:27.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能飛出去的拳頭… 鑽頭…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真浪漫啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,鑽頭？那是啥？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那大叔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:36.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有沒有事情想讓我幫你做？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:37.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,儘管說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也沒什麼特別的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙連探病都不來 在搞什麼啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:50.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露在嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:58.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她跑了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:07:59.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我為了保護她才少一隻手臂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她到底想怎樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的？那她當然會逃啊 大叔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼？我不是救了她一命嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為很尷尬啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會想說\n“是不是害你不能再冒險了”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,之類的啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:17.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:19.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這就是所謂的少女心嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我覺得比較像人情…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:26.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不能冒險的身體啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:28.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒辦法了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 安揚戈！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,唉？喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！住手啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:42.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣不行的啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:45.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始你在想什麼啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要乖乖休息才行吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:48.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 大叔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,公會那個大姐姐都哭了耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:52.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:55.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你先休息一陣子啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是她的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:00.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 還是回去比較好啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:03.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是史萊姆冒出來怎麼辦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:04.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不怎麼辦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:06.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你傷得很重耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會被打倒的啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哪有那種事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是這裡 就是這裡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的工作是回收優格果的果實\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:23.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是始 你現在這棵樹根本爬不上去啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:26.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看清楚了 蠢貨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:35.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我會從上面把繩子垂下去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:37.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們就沿著繩子爬上來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:41.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還挺滑的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙… 別礙事！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:52.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大叔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之 雖然出了點小差錯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:03.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但對我來說就是輕鬆啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都是莉露害的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:11.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,害你連樹都沒辦法好好爬了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:15.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,的確…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:18.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我本來有很多話想對你說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:22.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我也不擅長長篇大論…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一句話總結就是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你沒事真是太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:47.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露會變強的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露至少要強到能當你的左手…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:55.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 還要強到能養你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露一定會變強給你看的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:01.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你沒辦法\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:04.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也會變強 然後給大叔零用錢啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,兩個小鬼在說什麼啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:09.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,算了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:16.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我會等你們 但不會抱太大期待的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:22.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算叫我慢慢休息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:28.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也不太習慣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:31.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,義手什麼時候才會做好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作也還有一大堆呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我得趕快復出才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:37.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:40.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那種時候就該讓他們\n好好做一隻更棒的義手給你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:43.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡姐姐！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你回來啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:48.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟聽說青梅竹馬受了重傷嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你回來之前\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:54.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,公會的工作我們會幫你處理的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你又在打什麼主意？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這男人真失禮\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,椅子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:00.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:04.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,重傷後的冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,之後在冒險裡會怎樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看過很多了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要好好復健 好好休養\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你們沒問題嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:17.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也不打算亂來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:21.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且這傢伙就算在銀等級裡也是頂尖水準的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:25.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是只是個變態嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:27.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之就是這樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你別管我們 專心把身體養好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:37.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不急著趕工能花時間製作 是好事呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把義手品質做高\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:43.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對你或對村子都好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:44.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我試著組裝上了“模擬神經回路”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:55.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會動會動！這義手也太猛了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:59.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過果然沒有觸覺啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算是矮人族的技術\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那部分也沒辦法呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:08.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,除了那點以外\n我會讓它全面超越你原本的手！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,讓它能撐住任何冒險！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:14.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯！就算掉進火山！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算被龍踩扁！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都不痛不癢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我撐得住才怪！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:24.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才說矮人族真是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:30.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我在做椅子啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:36.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 上次族長不是把椅子壓壞了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:41.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這張椅子就算真的龍坐上去也不會壞！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很有矮人的作風呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈好厲害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這種東西你也做得出來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別這麼誇我啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:53.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟族長是我師父 我多少也會一點！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:57.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說你知道師父是什麼意思嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:58.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:00.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道的啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是很厲害的人對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:02.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:07.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老戴爺爺！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老戴爺爺 你沒事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:11.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,又拔蘿蔔閃到腰了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:16.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:19.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是今天還得再拔一點才行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:20.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別勉強自己動啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:24.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爺爺！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,交給莉露我們就好啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把這個拔起來就行嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:32.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對！就是這樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:36.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一、二！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這什麼鬼啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好噁心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別想跑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你還挺能幹的嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈好厲害！好厲害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:14:59.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也教教莉露啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:03.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-變熟練了呢\n-原來你也有派得上用場的特長嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:05.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-是爺爺教他們的？\n-你說啥！再拔一根試試啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:09.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,教安揚戈拔蘿蔔的師父就是我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,師父啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,戴上皮手套的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就不太看得出來是義手了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:26.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜歡真是太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:29.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過這技術真的太猛了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:31.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,族長也有師父嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,當然\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:39.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,年輕時我也曾在師父門下磨技術啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然是這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:45.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我用的是鈍器\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:46.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她用的是劍…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:51.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不擅長精靈術 莉露卻很擅長…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,與其只跟我學\n不如讓她跟別人學更好吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 這個按鈕是什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,發生什麼事？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我回來了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:10.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎回來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 義手做好啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,用起來挺順手的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:22.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙也回來了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聽說她大顯身手喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,劍術跟精靈術都很厲害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:29.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,椅子先生！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請問有什麼吩咐嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:52.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,脫了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:57.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥？你剛剛說什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:00.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,又不會少塊肉 脫一下又怎樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好有男子氣概！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,住手！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底發什麼瘋啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:08.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,先跟我告白才對吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我只是想看看體格…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:15.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:19.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪始 始♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:23.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪莉露是 女孩子喔♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:24.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪始 始♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:27.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪始呢 喜歡女孩子♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪喜歡♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:29.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:33.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪莉露是女孩子♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:37.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪在始的身邊♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:40.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪有莉露在♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:43.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪呵呵呵 就這樣啦♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這什麼夢啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:52.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你幹嘛擅自闖進別人的夢裡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:56.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別把夢魔的能力用在這種蠢事上啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是因為始你…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:17:59.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 準備一下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天… 我要確認\n那傢伙的劍術和精靈術\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:10.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夠不夠格當莉露的師父\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:11.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好看清楚！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（山狼）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:15.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的任務我也會跟著你們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:17.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹嘛啦！笨手笨腳的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:20.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,加油！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:21.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要跟著來工作我是不反對\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:26.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但你的手臂真的沒問題嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:28.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是復健 復健啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我能感覺到他的視線！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個笨蛋！居然無視我…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-在那邊看男人！\n-謝謝您！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:47.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝您！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛啦莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別一直盯著看 很沒禮貌耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:57.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對… 對不起啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:59.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露是擔心始的手臂…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:02.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就說了！你要我講幾次！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:05.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒事啦！真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:06.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我看清楚！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:14.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:24.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:28.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我換了這條手臂之後\n反而變得更強了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:31.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別一直在那邊哭哭啼啼的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聽懂了沒 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的？始沒有變弱嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:37.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,煩死了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小不點別去操心大人物啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:45.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 好猛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:47.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始果然超猛的啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:49.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你總算懂了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:53.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天要努力工作啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:57.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！我抓到山狼啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是兔子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:19:59.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放牠走\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你撿回一條命呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:04.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我明明得把那個男人看清楚才行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好灼熱的視線！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:13.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,越想越火大\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是看清那男人的好機會！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:21.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:25.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,輕輕鬆鬆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:27.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:30.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我這漂亮的一擊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:32.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,礙事的女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你幹嘛啦 很危險耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:41.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正為了我的自尊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:45.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:46.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:49.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女人生氣的點真搞不懂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:50.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別閃啦你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:54.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看的是那個男人的劍法啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:00.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:01.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,山狼牠…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:11.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然用弓啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 我用了弓…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:16.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是！不是說劍跟精靈術很強嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我聽說是那樣啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:21.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我一邊當薇洛妮卡大人的盾\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:24.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一邊用風的精靈術把敵人撕裂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以看起來像是在用劍砍吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:27.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:29.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那什麼鬼啦啊啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:34.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天一整天到底是在忙什麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:35.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,誰知道！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 始？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你沒事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我本來想看看會不會有人接手教你…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:48.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,結果看起來還是我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:52.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,除了始我都不要\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:54.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就重新請你多多指教啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:58.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,搭檔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:02.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 理髮與選擇）\n
